# This repository holds two projects: friday_kws/ (the ESP32-S3 firmware) and
# website/ (the PC pipeline and web console). Each has its own .gitignore for
# its own build output; this file covers the scratch that sits beside them in
# the working tree and is not part of the project.

# Sibling projects with their own histories -- not part of FRIDAY.
# `model/` and `vajra-edge-dataset/` are separate git repositories, so git would
# otherwise record them as embedded repositories and refuse to add them.
/model/
/vajra-edge-dataset/

# Datasets and archives staged next to the project, not source.
/dataset_bs/
*.zip

# Editor and OS scratch
.DS_Store
*~
.idea/
.vscode/
